===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|ῥίζα||root|tr=riza|sc=polytonic|lang=grc}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[horizontal]] [[underground]] [[stem]] of some [[plant]]s that sends out [[root]]s and [[shoot]]s from its [[node]]s.
# {{context|philosophy|lang=en}} A so-called "image of thought" that [[apprehend]]s [[multiplicity|multiplicities]]. See {{w|Rhizome (philosophy)}}.

